WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.405
The notes template is built around
what people need afterward,

2
00:00:03.405 --> 00:00:04.825
and that isn't a transcript.

3
00:00:04.825 --> 00:00:10.075
After a short header with attendees,
absentees and roles, it has four parts.

4
00:00:10.075 --> 00:00:13.000
Decisions, each with who decided and how.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.263
Action items, each with an
owner, a due date and a status.

6
00:00:17.263 --> 00:00:20.037
The parking lot, with
where each item is routed.

7
00:00:20.037 --> 00:00:23.813
And open questions, each with
who will answer, and by when.

8
00:00:23.813 --> 00:00:27.087
It ends by setting the next
meeting and its facilitator.

9
00:00:27.087 --> 00:00:30.430
Everything we've covered
also fits on a single page.
